{"articleNo":"575704","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=575704&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학본부] 학생상담 안내(수강신청/지도교수/심리/취업/학습법상담)","writer":"학생과","writeDate":"2026.08.31","hit":"8985","attachments":[{"name":"학생상담안내(홈페이지).png","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=575704&attachNo=167674"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;국립금오공과대학교 학생상담 안내&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">우리 대학은 </span><b><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\">학생들의 </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\">학업, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\">진로, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\">심리적 </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\">어려움, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\">그리고 </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\">학습 </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\">방법까지 </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\">다양한 </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\">영역에서 </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\">상담을 </span></b><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\">지원</span></b>합니다.</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></div><div><b><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">수강신청 </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">상담, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">지도교수 </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">상담, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">심리 상담, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">취업 상담, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">학습법 </span></b><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">상담</span></b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">을 </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">통해 </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">언제든 </span><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">필요한 </span></b></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">도움</span></b>을 </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">받을 </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">수 </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">있습니다.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">상담이 필요한 경우 해당 부서로 연락하거나 방문해 주시기 바랍니다. 감사합니다.</span></div><div><font face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">- 수강신청상담: 교무과(본관 303호)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">- 지도교수상담: 학생과(본관 101호)</span></div><div><font face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">- 심리상담: 학생상담센터(학생회관 202호)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">- 취업상담: 취업지원본부(학생회관 112호)</span></div><div><font face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">- 학습법상담: AX교수학습센터(공동실험실습관 201호)</span><br></span></font><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmDYHoQDkgpAigUQFoGkDyBPAkgWQEsBTAOQBljyAVACwAcBNAQwDp6A7AcyA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p><br></p></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
